{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838290/extras/86bcdb1a78634cdd194985f56eafe1ae.poster.avif?t=1757674973\" width=620 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838290/extras/86bcdb1a78634cdd194985f56eafe1ae.webm?t=1757674973\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838290/extras/86bcdb1a78634cdd194985f56eafe1ae.mp4?t=1757674973\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838290/extras/30aae01d02b9839e3ccffc1576574a0e.avif?t=1757674973\" width=600 height=220 /></span><br>LOUD: My Road to Fame is a music arcade rhythm game in which a teenage girl embarks on a heartwarming  journey of self-discovery through music.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838290/extras/d0e276259d3b36d18b505809bb395265.avif?t=1757674973\" width=600 height=220 /></span><br>Grab your gamepad and get ready to rock with new approachable and immersive arcade guitar controls. Keep your eyes sharp and fingers primed as each note has a good way to play it and a perfect one that requires additional input.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838290/extras/1a79a1c6b52398eccb5503fc9a1e9347.avif?t=1757674973\" width=596 height=220 /></span><br>Every track in LOUD has been produced by Hyperstrange\u2019s own band. Each out of the 21 tunes crafted with care for your auditory pleasure.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1838290/extras/1ee4ec65d1b03f605115e918f